Description:

FETCH THREADID now returns ``THREADID NIL`` for a message that has no
conversation, such as every message on a server without ``conversations:
yes``, as RFC 8474 requires.  It used to return ``THREADID (NIL)``, which a
client following the grammar reads as the thread id "NIL", shared by every
such message.


